    "body": "A PR is prepared to remedy this issue, note that the build will currently fail as it interferes with [the snap maintenance logic that will always check out a tagged release when the released version hasn't been promoted to the beta channel](https://github.com/starship/starship/blob/fd165b96cc9587f81ab68b580d371b71f4e0ff35/snapcraft.yaml#L63-L73), which won't contain the patch.\r\n",
